{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Traxxtar Videoview 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的極簡拍片工具，主打輕點螢幕即開始錄影、再點一下即停止，適合需要快速記錄片段、隨手存檔，或不想在相機介面中翻找按鈕的使用者。現時原價 US $0.99，限時免費，介面僅支援橫向拍攝。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-209.webp\">\n<h2>隨點隨錄的極簡拍攝體驗</h2>\n<p>錄影時無需尋找錄影鍵，輕點全螢幕預覽任何位置即可開始或停止，畫面只有脈動指示燈提示。停止後片段立即自動循環播放，可雙指縮放、拖曳平移，亦可拖動底片條逐格檢視。畫質可選 720p、1080p 或 4K，最高 60fps，播放時顯示實際錄得的解像度與格率。一按存入相片庫的「VideoView」相簿，另有防止休眠。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-11-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-12-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-13-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-14-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Traxxtar Videoview</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:58:46.600651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:37:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:57:49.933677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:36.251401+00:00","content_hash":"181cb8085f5e530259c392a9bc9465d6ae53fe5368dacfae592394f8cfec2f49","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}